{"ticker":"REG","updated":"2026-10-30T23:08:54Z","profile":{"longName":"Regency Centers Corporation","shortName":"Regency Centers Corporation","sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Retail","country":"United States","website":"https://www.regencycenters.com","fullTimeEmployees":503,"marketCap":13945251840,"trailingPE":25.114477,"forwardPE":29.858212,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":8.273501,"pegRatio":2.61,"targetMeanPrice":84.22222,"targetHighPrice":94.0,"targetLowPrice":76.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":18,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.089,"earningsGrowth":0.089,"grossMargins":0.71539,"operatingMargins":0.39643002,"profitMargins":0.32996,"totalRevenue":1685532032,"beta":0.823,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":83.66,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":66.86,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.03},"summary":"Regency Centers Corporation is a pre-eminent national owner, operator, and developer of shopping centers located in suburban trade areas with compelling demographics. Our portfolio includes thriving properties merchandised with highly productive grocers, restaurants, service providers, and best-in-class retailers that connect to their neighborhoods, communities, and customers. Operating as a fully integrated real estate company, Regency Centers is a qualified real estate investment trust (REIT) that is self-administered, self-managed, and an S&P 500 Index member. Regency Centers Corporation was incorporated in 1963 and is based in Jacksonville, Florida.","summary_zh":"Regency Centers Corporation 是一家傑出的全國性購物中心所有者、營運商和開發商，位於人口眾多的郊區貿易區。我們的投資組合包括與高生產力的雜貨店、餐廳、服務提供者和一流零售商銷售的蓬勃發展的房產，這些零售商與鄰裡、社區和客戶建立了聯繫。 Regency Centres 以完全一體化的房地產公司經營，是一家合格的房地產投資信託基金 (REIT)，具有自主經營、自我管理能力，並且是標準普爾 500 指數成員。 Regency Centers Corporation 成立於 1963 年，總部位於佛羅裡達州傑克遜維爾。","sector_zh":"房地產","industry_zh":"房地產投資信託基金 - 零售","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":72.3,"h":73.0,"l":71.93,"c":72.33,"v":1744500},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":71.95,"h":72.53,"l":71.84,"c":72.23,"v":771200},{"t":"2025-09-0